{"id":"wb-3-53","name":"安丰塘（芍陂）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芍陂","text":"芍陂，又名安丰塘，中国古代淮河流域水利工程，位于今安徽寿县。相传修建者是春秋时期楚国的孙叔敖。1970年代后，一些学者提出芍陂的修建不可能早于汉代。1978年经过整治，现蓄水量6677万立方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%8D%E9%99%82","revisionId":94274186,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94274186","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2e57d3effc29d12af5036dcc.jpg","title":"FILE0221.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:FILE0221.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/FILE0221.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Liuyiah","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​安丰塘边的孙公祠","width":320,"height":180}}